\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span>&gt;&gt; MORE INFO</a></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n                                            <div class=\"image-wrap\">\n                                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/-35a5581.webp\" alt data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\">\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                                    <div class=\"card-wrap\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                                        <div class=\"content-wrap\">\n                                            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                                    \n                                            </h5>\n                                            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                                                <br><br>Two bedroom apartment</h4>\n                                            <p class=\"card-desc mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-desc\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesc\">from € 78,00*/unit &amp; night (*non refundable rate Low season)<br></p>\n                                            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">A spacious haven with room for everyone, offering added privacy and comfort, designed for families or small groups seeking a relaxing getaway. With two bedrooms, two bathrooms, and a private balcony overlooking the mountains, this air-conditioned apartment offers the perfect blend of space, convenience, and tranquility. Facilities also include a well-equipped kitchenette with fridge and stovetop, a mini safe, a flat-screen TV and free WiFi.</p>\n                                            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mbri-wifi mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a>\n                                                <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"icon54-v1-air-conditioner1 mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"icon54-v3-smart-tv mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"icon54-v4-kitchen-sink mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a>  <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"imind-coffee-machine mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"icon54-v1-hairdryer mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a> <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"icon54-v3-showerheads-01 mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a>   <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"imind-broom mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span></a>   <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"icon54-v4-house-plan mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span>45m²</a> <a class=\"btn btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"imind-family-sign mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(198, 173, 114);\"></span>4x</a>   <a class=\"btn btn-info\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"https://book.roompanda.com/celininaxos\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"fa fa-calendar mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span>BOOK ONLINE</a> <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"https://book.roompanda.com/two-bedroom-apartment\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"fa fa-info-circle mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span>&gt;&gt; MORE INFO</a></div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"item-wrapper position-relative\">\n                                            <div class=\"image-wrap\">\n                                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/-35a5588-hdr.webp\" alt data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                             